          "text": "For calling Summit Air. This is the virtual assistant. How can I help?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "I want to cancel my appointment. It's under Jackson.",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Sure, I can help with that. Can I ask what changed?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "The what?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Sorry, I mean, is there a reason you're canceling? It's fine if you'd rather not say.",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "I don't know. Just cancel it, okay?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Okay. I'll look for your appointment under Jackson now. I don't see an account under this number. Can you tell me the street address the appointment is for?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "I don't know which address it is. Um, it's under Jackson Lee.",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "It. Let me try a name search with the address. So I need the street first. What's the house number and street where the visit is?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "Say that again? The house number?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "The house number and street name of the place the visit is booked for?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "I don't know. I'm not sure which one it is. Can you just look up Jackson Lee?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "I can't search by name alone, but I can look for an account by address. Do you know the street even roughly? Or the zip code where the visit is?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "No. I don't know. Okay, that's all. Bye.",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Okay. If you find the address later, just call back and we can take care of it. Thanks for calling Summit Air. Have a great rest of your day.",
          "said": null
        }
